{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0209","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000039:text","row":29790,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「もぐもぐ…………はっ！？」","en":"“Munch munch………… Huh!?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800608","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Munch, munch...... huh?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000075:text","row":29791,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「曜子ちゃん、もしかしてお腹すいてるの？」","en":"“Yoko, are you hungry, by any chance?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800609","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Youko-chan, could it be that you are hungry?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000000b7:text","row":29792,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"こくこくと頷く。","en":"She nods vigorously.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800610","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00003","en":"Bob bob steady nod.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000000e7:text","row":29793,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「食べる？」","en":"“Want some?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800611","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00004","en":"Taichi: \"Wanna eat?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:0000010b:text","row":29794,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"こくこくと頷く。","en":"She nods vigorously.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800612","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00005","en":"Bob bob steady nod.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:0000013b:text","row":29795,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃ、こっち来なよ。食べさせてあげるから」","en":"“Then come here. I'll feed you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800613","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00006","en":"Taichi: \"Then, come here. I will be feeding you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000001e0:text","row":29796,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"大股で一歩、近づく。","en":"She takes one long stride closer.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800614","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00007","en":"She approaches in a single long stride.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:0000020c:text","row":29797,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"こちらのいじめを避けて離れていたが、これで至近距離だ。","en":"She'd kept her distance to escape my teasing, but now she's right in front of me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800615","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00008","en":"That was the distance to avoid my bullying, but this is point-blank range.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000262:text","row":29798,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、あーん」","en":"“Here. Open wide.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800616","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00009","en":"Taichi: \"Say, aaaah.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:0000028a:text","row":29799,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"口をあける。","en":"She opens her mouth.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800617","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00010","en":"Mouth opens.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000002ae:text","row":29800,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"サンドイッチを押し進める。","en":"I move the sandwich toward her mouth.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800618","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00011","en":"The sandwich marches onwards.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000002e0:text","row":29801,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"口が閉じる直前で引っ込め、自分で食った。","en":"Just before her mouth closes, I yank it back and eat it myself.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800619","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00012","en":"The very moment before the mouth closes I pull it back and eat it myself.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000328:text","row":29802,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「うまうま」","en":"“Yummy yummy.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800620","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00013","en":"Taichi: \"Nom, nom!\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000354:text","row":29803,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………………………………………」","en":"“…………………………………………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800621","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00014","en":"Youko: \"........................\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000398:text","row":29804,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「ごめんごめん、冗談だよ」","en":"“Sorry, sorry. Just kidding.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800622","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Sorry, sorry, just joking.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000003d2:text","row":29805,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、今度こそ。あーん」","en":"“Okay, for real this time. Open wide.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800623","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00016","en":"Taichi: \"Here, this time for real. Say aaaah.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000465:text","row":29806,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"同じことが繰り返された。","en":"The same thing happens again.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800624","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00017","en":"I repeated the same thing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:0000049d:text","row":29807,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「うまうま」","en":"“Yummy yummy.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800625","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Nom, nom!\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000004c9:text","row":29808,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………………………………………………………………………」","en":"“……………………………………………………………………………………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800626","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00019","en":"Youko: \"................................................\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000525:text","row":29809,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"プレッシャーを感じた。","en":"I feel the pressure.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800627","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00020","en":"I felt pressure.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:0000055b:text","row":29810,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「うそうそ。今度こそちゃんとするよ」","en":"“Kidding, kidding. This time I really mean it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800628","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Kiddin', kiddin! This time it's really for real!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:0000059f:text","row":29811,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほら、どーぞ」","en":"“Here you go.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800629","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00022","en":"Taichi: \"Here, haaave it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000005c7:text","row":29812,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"左側に掲げる。","en":"I hold it up on the left.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800630","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00023","en":"I float it to the left.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the object is held up to one side; it does not float.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":10,"start":2,"text":"float it"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000673:text","row":29813,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ……」","en":"“Ah...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800631","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00024","en":"Youko: \"Ah...\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000695:text","row":29814,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんがサンドイッチめがけてよろっと動く。","en":"Yoko totters toward the sandwich.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800632","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00025","en":"Youko-chan moves in a totter, sandwich the aim.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000006db:text","row":29815,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"すかさず反対側に手をやる。","en":"I immediately move my hand to the other side.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800633","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00026","en":"Without delay I send the hand to the opposite side.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000793:text","row":29816,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ……」","en":"“Ah...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800634","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00027","en":"Youko: \"Ah...\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000007b5:text","row":29817,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"反対側に動く。","en":"She moves the other way.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800635","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00028","en":"She moves to the opposite side.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:000008b3:text","row":29818,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"六往復繰り返した。","en":"We go back and forth six times.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800636","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00029","en":"Six more times around and around we repeated all over again.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000a29:text","row":29819,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いい、帰ってひきこもるから」","en":"“...Never mind. I'll go home and shut myself away.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800637","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00030","en":"Youko: \"...'s fine. Going home to hikikomori.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese uses a verb meaning to go home and shut oneself away; the English turns the noun label into an ungrammatical destination.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":20,"text":"Going home to hikikomori"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0209:00000a6b:text","row":29820,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「冗談だってば」","en":"“I said I was kidding.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800638","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0033a:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Told you I'm joking!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
